{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一架掛上「P」牌的私家車在大圍撞倒石壆後翻側，司機輕傷送院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">四輪朝天的私家車已被移「翻正」。車身多處損毀，擋風玻璃碎裂。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.MOS-0230_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Q3j132s9Im1788392507.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.MOS-0230_002.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方指凌晨零時許，涉事私家車沿積運街左轉入美田路時，撞向路中鐵欄路壆後翻轉。19歲男司機手部擦傷，酒精呼氣測試為零度，由救護員送院治理。警方調查事故原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T01:04:12.844988+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}